{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15070","headline":"元日望含元殿御扇开合 · 章八元","name":"元日望含元殿御扇开合","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国来朝岁，千年觐圣君。\n辇迎仙杖出，扇匝御香焚。\n俯对朝容近，先知曙色分。\n冕旒开处见，钟磬合时闻。\n影动承朝日，花攒似庆云。\n蒲葵那可比，徒用隔炎氛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章八元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}